new-page: true 

= Argentina Altobelli

Altobelli is a member of the executive of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_full_name +]</span>. Aligned with the <span style="color:#FF6961">reformists</span> within the party, she currently leads and is a founding member of the the *National Federation of Agricultural Workers*, being the first woman to lead a trade union in <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">It</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">a</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">ly</span>.

- @womens_rights_altobelli
- @party_discipline_altobelli
- @agriculture_ministry_altobelli
- @root: Return to main

@womens_rights_altobelli
title: Women's Rights
subtitle: Now that we are in government, we can now reform the laws to improve the status of women.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not currently in government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and psi_in_government
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; womens_rights_timer -= 5;
go-to: womens_rights

@party_discipline_altobelli
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Altobelli can leverage her position to mediate <span style="color:#FF6961">reformist</span> and <span style="color:#B22222">labour</span> dissent.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (reformist_dissent > 0 or labour_dissent > 0)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if (reformist_dissent = 0 and labour_dissent = 0) : The <span style="color:#FF6961">Reformists</span> and <span style="color:#B22222">Labour</span> are the most united it has been since its inception. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; labour_dissent -= 5;

Altobelli is able to leverage her position to quell dissent between <span style="color:#B22222">labour</span> and the <span style="color:#FF6961">reformists</span>, brokering compromises and strengthening the unity of the party.

@agriculture_ministry_altobelli
title: Agricultural Policy
subtitle: Having control of the Agricultural Ministry, we can implement policies that will help our rural supporters.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psi_in_government and agriculture_minister_party == psi_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The [+ psi_name +] is not in government to influence policy. ?][? if not agriculture_minister_party == psi_name : The [+ psi_name +] does not control the Agricultural Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: agricultural_policy